    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-930475fd096df1a1fe75674d",
      "canonicalType": "Formula",
      "label": "c(t)= \\sum_{j=1}^{q} A_{j} \\mathrm{e}^{s_{j} t}+\\sum_{k=1}^{r} B_{k} \\mathrm{e}^{-\\zeta_{k} \\omega_{k} t} \\cos \\left(\\omega_{k} \\sqrt{1-\\zeta_{k}^{2}}\\right) t +\\sum_{k=1}^{r} \\frac{C_{k}-B_{k} \\zeta_{k} \\omega_{k}}{\\omega_{k} \\sqrt{1-\\zeta_{k}^{2}}} \\mathrm{e}^{-\\zeta_{k} \\omega_{k} t} \\sin \\left(\\omega_{k} \\sqrt{1-\\zeta_{k}^{2}}\\right) t, \\quad t \\geqslant 0",
